IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- LAYER 1: section 2025(d), (e), (f), (i) and (j): performance indicators, social security account numbers, legal fees,
-- geographical error-prone profiles, training materials
-- (7 U.S.C. 2025; lines 2044-2085, 2325-2329 of usc07-ch51.txt, a converter's plain-text rendering, not the official text).
-- Money is a NUMBER of dollars. JUST TRUE / JUST FALSE / JUST n is what the text says, NOTHING is "not covered" (NOTES.md, Reading a result).

-- s 2025(d)(5): what a State agency does with a performance bonus payment.
DECLARE `s 2025(d)(5) use of a bonus payment` IS ONE OF
    `s 2025(d)(5)(A) technology`
    `s 2025(d)(5)(B) improvements in administration and distribution`
    `s 2025(d)(5)(C) actions to prevent fraud, waste, and abuse`
    `s 2025(d)(5) another use that carries out the program established under this chapter`
    `s 2025(d)(5) a use that does not carry out the program established under this chapter`

§ `s 2025(d) State performance indicators`

-- src:2047 | With respect to fiscal years 2003 and 2004, the Secretary shall establish, in guidance issued to State agencies not later than October 1, 2002—
@ref s 2025(d)(1)(A) guidance not later than October 1, 2002 (src:2047)
GIVEN `date the guidance is issued` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(d)(1)(A) the guidance is issued in time` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `date the guidance is issued` AT MOST (Date 1 10 2002) THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "in guidance issued to State agencies not later than October 1, 2002"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

-- src:2048 | (i) performance criteria relating to—
-- src:2049 | (I) actions taken to correct errors, reduce rates of error, and improve eligibility determinations; and
-- src:2050 | (II) other indicators of effective administration determined by the Secretary; and
-- src:2051 | (ii) standards for high and most improved performance to be used in awarding performance bonus payments under subparagraph (B)(ii).
@ref s 2025(d)(1)(A)(i)-(ii) what the guidance must establish (src:2048-2051)
GIVEN `it establishes performance criteria relating to actions taken to correct errors, reduce rates of error, and improve eligibility determinations` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it establishes performance criteria relating to other indicators of effective administration determined by the Secretary` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it establishes standards for high and most improved performance to be used in awarding performance bonus payments` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(d)(1)(A) the guidance has the content required` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `it establishes performance criteria relating to actions taken to correct errors, reduce rates of error, and improve eligibility determinations`
            AND `it establishes performance criteria relating to other indicators of effective administration determined by the Secretary`
            AND `it establishes standards for high and most improved performance to be used in awarding performance bonus payments`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the Secretary shall establish, in guidance issued to State agencies"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

-- src:2053 | With respect to each of fiscal years 2003 and 2004, the Secretary shall—
-- src:2054 | (i) measure the performance of each State agency with respect to the criteria established under subparagraph (A)(i); and
@ref s 2025(d)(1)(B)(i) measure the performance of each State agency (src:2053-2054)
GIVEN `fiscal year` IS A NUMBER
      `the Secretary has measured the performance of each State agency against the criteria` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(d)(1)(B)(i) the performance of each State agency has been measured` MEANS
    BRANCH
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "With respect to each of fiscal years 2003 and 2004"
        IF `fiscal year` EQUALS 2003 OR `fiscal year` EQUALS 2004 THEN
            BRANCH
                IF `the Secretary has measured the performance of each State agency against the criteria` THEN JUST TRUE
                -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the Secretary shall— (i) measure the performance of each State agency"
                OTHERWISE JUST FALSE
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): paragraph (1) is for "Fiscal years 2003 and 2004"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- src:2055 | (ii) subject to paragraph (3), award performance bonus payments in the following fiscal year, in a total amount of $48,000,000 for each fiscal year, to State agencies that meet standards for high or most improved performance established by the Secretary under subparagraph (A)(ii).
@ref s 2025(d)(1)(B)(ii) a total of $48,000,000 for each fiscal year (src:2055)
GIVEN `fiscal year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 2025(d)(1)(B)(ii) the total amount of performance bonus payments for the fiscal year` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `fiscal year` EQUALS 2003 OR `fiscal year` EQUALS 2004 THEN JUST 48_000_000
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "With respect to each of fiscal years 2003 and 2004"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

@ref s 2025(d)(1)(B)(ii) award in the following fiscal year to State agencies that meet the standards (src:2055)
GIVEN `fiscal year of the performance` IS A NUMBER
      `fiscal year of the award` IS A NUMBER
      `the State agency meets the standards for high or most improved performance` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the State agency is eligible for a performance bonus payment for the fiscal year` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(d)(1)(B)(ii) the State agency shall be awarded a performance bonus payment` MEANS
    BRANCH
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "With respect to each of fiscal years 2003 and 2004"
        IF (NOT (`fiscal year of the performance` EQUALS 2003 OR `fiscal year of the performance` EQUALS 2004)) THEN NOTHING
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "award performance bonus payments in the following fiscal year"
        IF (NOT (`fiscal year of the award` EQUALS (`fiscal year of the performance` PLUS 1))) THEN JUST FALSE
        IF `the State agency is eligible for a performance bonus payment for the fiscal year` EQUALS JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE
        IF `the State agency meets the standards for high or most improved performance` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- NOTHING-kind (silent): a State agency that does not meet the standards is not mentioned
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- src:2066 | (i) measure the performance of each State agency with respect to the criteria established under subparagraph (A)(i); and
@ref s 2025(d)(2)(B)(i) measure the performance of each State agency (src:2066)
GIVEN `fiscal year` IS A NUMBER
      `the Secretary has measured the performance of each State agency against the criteria` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(d)(2)(B)(i) the performance of each State agency has been measured` MEANS
    BRANCH
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "With respect to fiscal year 2005 through fiscal year 2017"
        IF `fiscal year` AT LEAST 2005 AND `fiscal year` AT MOST 2017 THEN
            BRANCH
                IF `the Secretary has measured the performance of each State agency against the criteria` THEN JUST TRUE
                -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the Secretary shall— (i) measure the performance of each State agency"
                OTHERWISE JUST FALSE
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): paragraph (2) is for "Fiscal years 2005 through 2017"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- src:2067 | (ii) subject to paragraph (3), award performance bonus payments in the following fiscal year, in a total amount of $48,000,000 for each fiscal year, to State agencies that meet standards for high or most improved performance established by the Secretary under subparagraph (A)(ii).
